  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How's life treating you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Moshi, I'm hosting a board game night on Saturday for six people. What should I prepare?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Pick two or three games, one easy, one longer, and maybe a quick party game. Read the rules before they arrive.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait, good point, I always forget the rules halfway.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Watching a short rules video beforehand helps. For food, go for things that aren't greasy, like crackers, fruit or popcorn.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Greasy fingers on the cards, yeah.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. And keep drinks on a separate small table so nothing gets spilled on the board.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.08,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "do a little prize for the winner?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.03,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg15",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
